WEBVTT

00:00:30.026 --> 00:00:32.737
General good business acumen isn't enough.

00:00:33.237 --> 00:00:36.866
The thing the rock stars
all have in common

00:00:36.866 --> 00:00:39.452
is they disrupt business as usual.

00:00:40.036 --> 00:00:41.871
They look at things the way they are,

00:00:41.913 --> 00:00:45.249
and say to themselves,
"Nah, that's not it."

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:50.755
Consider how we used to search,
and how cumbersome the process was.

00:00:51.172 --> 00:00:52.924
Sergey Brin and Larry Page

00:00:52.965 --> 00:00:57.261
completely transformed the way
we find things and each other,

00:00:57.303 --> 00:00:59.680
and even how we buy things.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.099
And what about coffee?